undant. The tourists visit mostly in the summer. Texel is an island with four types of landscape: dunes and beaches in the west, flatland and polders in the east and hilly in the center of the island (the remains of the ice age). Inland you find the fourth landscape - wetlands - with beautiful walking trails in the centre west coast of the island, like The Slufter. Along the wadden-coast in the east there are comparably smaller Wetlands. In the dunes, valleys like The Muy are quite popular with tourists.","grounding":[{"source":"wikivoyage","title":"Texel","url":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Texel","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"facts":{"population":1025,"visit_h":3.3}},"highlights":[{"id":"hl-eierland-lighthouse","name":"Eierland Lighthouse","kind":"Lighthouse","lat":53.18194,"lon":4.85528,"dist_km":11.3,"rank_score":7.87,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image":{"url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Eierland%20Lighthouse%20texel.jpg?width=960","author":"Yornik Heyl","licence":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Eierland_Lighthouse_texel.jpg","w":2289,"h":3434,"ok_print":true}},{"id":"hl-noorderhaaks","name":"Noorderhaaks","kind":"Island","lat":52.975,"lon":4.68056,"dist_km":14.6,"rank_score":7.52,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image":{"url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Den%20Helder%204.77628E%2052.95026N.jpg?width=960","author":"NASA","licence":"Public domain","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Den_Helder_4.77628E_52.95026N.jpg","w":1280,"h":958,"ok_print":true}},{"id":"hl-dunes-of-texel-national-park","name":"Dunes of Texel National Park","kind":"National park","lat":53.14583,"lon":4.8025,"dist_km":6.0,"rank_score":7.22,"resolved_by":"catalogue","image":{"url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/De%20Nederlanden.jpg?width=960","author":"Alex76","licence":"CC BY-SA 3.0 nl","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.or